  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "What holds finance websites back",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-58\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-58\">What holds <span class=\"accent\">finance websites</span> back</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">And how we fix it.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pf-list\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__problem\"><span class=\"pf__label\">The problem</span><p>Compliance slows every new page down, so content rarely gets published.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pf__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__fix\"><span class=\"pf__label\">How we fix it</span><p>We agree a review process with your compliance team up front, with templates for claims and disclaimers.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__problem\"><span class=\"pf__label\">The problem</span><p>Pages are thin, generic or written without real expertise.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pf__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__fix\"><span class=\"pf__label\">How we fix it</span><p>Finance writers draft, your experts review, and author details are shown on every page.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__problem\"><span class=\"pf__label\">The problem</span><p>Big comparison sites take the top spots for every product search.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pf__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__fix\"><span class=\"pf__label\">How we fix it</span><p>We target the specific, high-intent searches they miss, and build tools and guides they can’t copy.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__problem\"><span class=\"pf__label\">The problem</span><p>Rates and rules change, and old pages go out of date.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pf__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pf__fix\"><span class=\"pf__label\">How we fix it</span><p>We schedule regular content reviews so every page stays accurate.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "financial-services-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
