   "attrs": {
    "label": "Your first three months",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"timeline-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"process-title\">Your first <span class=\"accent\">three months</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Compliance is planned in from the start, so nothing gets stuck.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"timeline\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Week 1–2</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Audit and compliance set-up</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A full SEO review and an agreed review process with your compliance team.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Week 3–6</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Fix and strengthen</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Technical fixes, trust signals and updates to your key product pages.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Month 2–3</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Expert content</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Guides and pages for the searches with the most value, reviewed by your experts.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Every month</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Report and review</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Leads, rankings and content accuracy checks.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "financial-services-seo",
    "modules": []
