  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Financial services SEO questions, answered",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-60\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-60\">Financial services SEO questions, <span class=\"accent\">answered</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a topic. Can’t find your answer? Ask us on a free 30-minute call.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs tabs--pills faq-tabs\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"FAQ topics\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-61-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"tabs-61-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\">The service</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-61-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"tabs-61-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">Compliance</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-61-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"tabs-61-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Results</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panels\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-61-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-61-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>What is financial services SEO? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">SEO for banks, fintech, insurance, wealth and accounting firms, with extra focus on expertise, trust and compliance.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Do you work with accounting firms? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Yes. We build service pages by client type, tax-season content and local SEO for each office.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-61-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-61-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How do you handle compliance? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">We agree a review process with your compliance team before we start, and nothing goes live without approval.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Can you work with our legal disclaimers? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Yes. We build them into page templates so every page includes the right wording.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-61-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-61-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How long does finance SEO take? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Finance is competitive, so expect steady growth over six to twelve months, with quicker wins on specific, high-intent searches.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How do you measure results? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Leads, applications and sign-ups from search, tracked in your CRM, alongside rankings for your key products.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-tabs__more\"><a class=\"button button--outline\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "financial-services-seo",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
